# Do not use this example as a trust registry.
#
# After the owner explicitly approves a dedicated saved-plan signing public
# key, create the tracked file `plan.allowed-signers` with one OpenSSH
# allowed-signers entry in this form:
#
# apptolast-terraform-plan namespaces="terraform-saved-plan" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... approved-terraform-plan-key
